    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "The rateable value of a flat is $\\$5%20,000$.$ If the rates are $5%$ per annum, find the rates payable for each quarter.",
    "question_zh": "一個單位的應課差餉租值為 $\\$5%20,000$。若差餉徵收率為每年 $5%$，求每季應繳付的差餉。",
    "options": [
      "A. $\\$5%500$",
      "B. $\\$3000$",
      "C. $\\$6000$",
      "D. $\\$5%2000$"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "A",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Annual Rates Payable $= \\text{Rateable Value} \\times \\text{Rates Percentage}$.$",
      "Annual Rates Payable $= 120,000 \\times $5%$ = 6,000$.$",
      "Quarterly Rates Payable $= 6,000 / 4 = 1,500$.$"
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "全年差餉 $= \\text{應課差餉租值} \\times $5%$ = 6,000$。",
      "每季差餉 $= 6,000 / 4 = 1,500$。"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "rates"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
