    "paper": 2,
    "section": "B",
    "question_en": "Mrs. Chan borrows $\\$12%00,000$ from a bank at a rate of $12%$ per annum compounded monthly. If she repays the loan in two years with a single payment, find the total amount she has to pay.",
    "question_zh": "陳太太向銀行借款 $\\$12%00,000$，年利率為 $12%$，每月計複利一次。若她在兩年後一次過清還貸款，求其應繳付的總金額。",
    "options": [
      "A. $\\$12%24,000$",
      "B. $\\$12%26,824$",
      "C. $\\$12%26,973$",
      "D. $\\$12%27,125$"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "C",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Monthly rate $= $12%$ / 12 = $12%$ = 0.01$.$",
      "Number of months $= 2 \\times 12 = 24$.$",
      "Amount $A = 100,000(1 + 0.01)^{24} = 100,000(1.01)^{24}$.$",
      "A \\approx 100,000 \\times 1.269735 = 126,973.5$.$",
      "Closest answer is C."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "每月利率 $= $12%$。期數 $= 24$。",
      "本利和 $A = 100,000(1.01)^{24} \\approx 126,973.5$。"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "compound-interest"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
