    "question_en": "What sum of money will amount to $\\$6600$ in $4$ years at $8%$ per annum simple interest?",
    "question_zh": "何項款項在 $4$ 年後按年利率 $8%$ 的單利息計算會增值至 $\\$6600$？",
    "options": [
      "A. $\\$4500$",
      "B. $\\$4800$",
      "C. $\\$5000$",
      "D. $\\$5200$"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "C",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Amount $A = P(1 + RT)$.$",
      "6600 = P(1 + 0.08 \\times 4) = P(1.32)$.$",
      "P = 6600 / 1.32 = 5000$.$"
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "本利和 $A = P(1 + RT)$。",
      "6600 = P(1 + 0.32) = 1.32P$。",
      "P = 5000$。"
    ],
