    ],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 7,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "B",
    "question_en": "The amount of $\\$P$ compounded half-yearly at $r%$ per annum for $n$ years is:",
    "question_zh": "本金 $\\$P$，以年利率 $r%$ 每半年計複利一次。$n$ 年後的本利和為：",
    "options": [
      "A. $P(1 + r%)^{2n}$",
      "B. $P(1 + r%/2)^{n}$",
      "C. $P(1 + r%/2)^{2n}$",
      "D. $P(1 + 2r%)^{n/2}$"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "C",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Rate per half-year $= r% / 2$\\text{HK$}.$",
      "Number of half-year periods in $n$ years $= 2n$\\text{HK$}.$",
      "Compound interest formula: $A = P(1 + \\text{rate per period})^{\\text{number of periods}}$\\text{HK$}.$",
      "So, $A = P(1 + r%/2)^{2n}$\\text{HK$}.$"
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "每半年利率 $= r% / 2$。",
      "期數 $= 2n$。",
      "本利和 $= P(1 + r%/2)^{2n}$。"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "compound-interest",
      "formula"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
